# ============================================================
#  Huilo package list (one package per line, '#' = comment)
#
#  Section headers with a [tag] are OPTIONAL groups that can be
#  left out:  ./build.sh --without office,games   (or --minimal)
#             bash i.sh --without office,games    (online installer)
#  Sections without a tag are the core system.
#  List the groups:  scripts/pkg-select.sh --list-groups
# ============================================================

